  "help": "<p>Sambamba sort performs sorting of BAM files.</p>\n<dl class=\"docutils\">\n<dt>BAM files can have either 'coordinate' or 'qname' sort order.</dt>\n<dd><ul class=\"first last simple\">\n<li>'coordinate' sorting order : Sorts Reads by (integer) reference ID, and for each reference sort corresponding reads by start coordinate.</li>\n<li>'qname' sorting order : Reads are sorted lexicographically by their names.</li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n",
